infiltrator-software (0.3.89) unstable; urgency=high

  * Make the Common submodule gitlink the single authority for its exact
    revision, removing duplicated commit/version identity from the build and
    eliminating release-script parsing of CMake source text.
  * Move regression target definitions out of the production top-level build
    file into tests/CMakeLists.txt and remove the GUI target's unused direct
    software-installed-state link.
  * Preserve the verified build, package, smoke, AppStream and deterministic
    release gates while reducing build/release coupling.

 -- Shannon Smith <infiltratr@yandex.com>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:02:00 +1100
